# Geary-style account setup, folder discovery, and initial synchronization.

C: A001 ID ("name" "Geary" "version" "46.0")
S: A001 OK

C: A002 LOGIN "user@example.test" "password"
S: A002 OK

C: A003 CAPABILITY
S: A003 OK

C: A004 NAMESPACE
S: A004 OK

C: A005 LIST (SUBSCRIBED) "" "*" RETURN (CHILDREN SPECIAL-USE STATUS (MESSAGES UNSEEN UIDNEXT UIDVALIDITY))
S: A005 OK

C: A006 SELECT INBOX (CONDSTORE)
S: A006 OK

C: A007 UID SEARCH RETURN (ALL COUNT) UNDELETED
S: A007 OK

C: A008 UID FETCH 1:* (UID FLAGS MODSEQ INTERNALDATE RFC822.SIZE ENVELOPE BODYSTRUCTURE BODY.PEEK[HEADER.FIELDS (DATE FROM SENDER REPLY-TO TO CC BCC SUBJECT MESSAGE-ID IN-REPLY-TO REFERENCES)])
S: A008 OK

C: A009 LOGOUT
S: A009 OK
